# Upstream rule: ignore everything, then allow source/document file types.
# Because "*" also matches folders, new files in sub-folders must be added with "git add -f".
*
!*.py
!*.md
!*.txt
!*.jpg
!*.png
!requirements*
!*.bat

# Never commit these, even with an allowed extension (local, personal or large files):
# virtual environments, user data (settings, downloaded DFM models, samples, outputs),
# screenshots, bundled tools (ffmpeg), build output, caches and secrets.
.venv*/
userdata/
_ekran/
_tools/
_build/
Builds/
__pycache__/
/*.png
/*.jpg
*.dfm
*.mp4
*.avi
*.mkv
*.mov
*.webm
*.dat
*.7z
*.7z.*
*.zip
*.log
.env
.env.*
*.pem
*.key
